  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Irrigated Crop Production. (Self-help Grant).Beneficiaries: 225 of which 150 are women.This small grant will provide irrigated crop production to help small scale farmers to earn increased income. USADF funds will help 150 people to purchase water pump, fencing a garden, and provide training and capacity building for the group. .</narrative>
